# Real CLAUDE/AI/backlog content lives here. Out of git on purpose:
#   1. Insights and accumulated knowledge shouldn't reset on
#      branch-switch — `.claude/` is shared across all branches.
#   2. Crossing off tasks shouldn't pollute feature-PR diffs with
#      unrelated checkmarks.
# Stub files at repo root (`CLAUDE.md`, `AI.md`, `backlog.md`)
# point readers to the `.claude/` originals after a fresh clone.
.claude/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
